THIRD-PARTY CONTENT
-------------------

This project incorporates the following public-domain material. Neither is
covered by the copyright above, and each is used on its own terms.

ENABLE word list (data/enable1.txt)
  Enhanced North American Benchmark Lexicon, by Alan Beale and Mendel Cooper.
  Released into the public domain. Filtered before use to remove slurs and
  crude terms; see scripts/lib/blocklist.mjs.

WordNet 3.1 (data/wordnet.json, built from the wordnet-db package)
  Princeton University "About WordNet." WordNet. Princeton University. 2010.
  Used under the WordNet licence, which permits use, copying, modification and
  distribution, including for commercial purposes, with the copyright notice
  and this paragraph retained.

  Replaced Webster's Unabridged Dictionary (1913), which was archaic, carried
  the racial language of its era inside ordinary entries, and whose JSON
  transcription had unresolved provenance. That file is no longer used.

No sampled audio, webfonts or third-party icons are used. Sound is synthesised
at runtime with the Web Audio API; icons are generated by scripts/build-icons.py.
